lgis, though Prince Henri’s reckless charge forces them into a grueling battle. In the aftermath, Romelia is branded \"dead weight\" for not fighting directly, and the Prince unilaterally breaks off their engagement. Denied a place in the victory celebrations, Romelia returns home, only to be met with cold indifference from her family and society. Yet, she refuses to break. She has already set her sights on the path that lies ahead.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\n\n\nNote: Romelia War Chronicle was streamed 2 days in advance of the TV broadcast on AnimeTimes, U-NEXT, and Netflix beginning October 3, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on October 5, 2026."],"ja":["ロメリア戦記 〜魔王を倒した後も人類やばそうだから軍隊組織した〜",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78652":"2026-10-23T16:30:39Z","serial-78601":"2026-10-20T09:52:59Z","serial-78715":"2026-10-20T09:50:52Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-78652","serial-78601","serial-78715"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":7.27}]}